//   currentConstrainedOut that is still parser-valid. The rollback branch uses
//   RollbackConstrainedSuffix, whose result is a valid constrained prefix.
// progress: In the outside-span chunk branch, steps increases by stepsUsed and
//   UnconstrainedChunk appends at most that many visible tokens, so
//   |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps is preserved even if EOS is
//   counted but not appended. In the explicit-open and close branches, each
//   helper consumes one token-step and appends at most one visible delimiter,
